+## User request
+Implement the newest PLAN in CONTEXTS/03-implement-plan/ exactly per its scope and DoD: search/filter box on the Sessions page.
+
+## Reason
+PLAN-012 (review_count 1, patch not-needed): as session count grows the list needs a filter. Client-side only per BDR-001/BDR-002, reuses vendored shadcn Input per ADR-006, filters SessionSummary per ADR-007.
+
+## Description
+Implemented PLAN-012: added a client-side search box on the Sessions page. New pure filterSessions helper in web/src/lib/session-filter.ts (trim + lowercase + substring over id, raw ISO started_at, and the locale-formatted started_at; empty query returns the full list) with unit tests. Sessions.tsx wires a controlled shadcn Input above the table, filters visible rows per keystroke with no submit, and shows the pinned Empty state (SearchX icon, 'No matching sessions') when nothing matches while the input stays visible.
+
+## Files changed
+web/src/lib/session-filter.ts
+web/src/lib/session-filter.test.ts
